        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gamble Your Breath</strong> is a darkly atmospheric click-based survival game where every spin, every card, and every click could be your last breath.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124170/extras/61e04ca901f07044184841d1d0197242.poster.avif?t=1782332542\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124170/extras/61e04ca901f07044184841d1d0197242.webm?t=1782332542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re locked in a small, decaying room with one rule — earn enough oxygen before time runs out, or suffocate trying.<br><br>Each round, you take risks, collect charms, and face hidden curses that twist the rules of survival. The deeper you go, the higher the stakes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124170/extras/8d79127303e85daea3bb387386d7dc04.poster.avif?t=1782332542\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124170/extras/8d79127303e85daea3bb387386d7dc04.webm?t=1782332542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124170/extras/8d79127303e85daea3bb387386d7dc04.mp4?t=1782332542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luck won’t save you; only strategy and nerve will.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gamble Your Breath</strong> is a darkly atmospheric click-based survival game where every spin, every card, and every click could be your last breath.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124170/extras/61e04ca901f07044184841d1d0197242.poster.avif?t=1782332542\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124170/extras/61e04ca901f07044184841d1d0197242.webm?t=1782332542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re locked in a small, decaying room with one rule — earn enough oxygen before time runs out, or suffocate trying.<br><br>Each round, you take risks, collect charms, and face hidden curses that twist the rules of survival. The deeper you go, the higher the stakes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124170/extras/8d79127303e85daea3bb387386d7dc04.poster.avif?t=1782332542\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124170/extras/8d79127303e85daea3bb387386d7dc04.webm?t=1782332542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124170/extras/8d79127303e85daea3bb387386d7dc04.mp4?t=1782332542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luck won’t save you; only strategy and nerve will.</p>",
